FALSE

=== regex test searches anywhere (1)
IMPORT "regex"
PRINT REGEX_TEST("Hallo Welt", "Welt")
PRINT REGEX_TEST("Hallo Welt", "X")
PRINT REGEX_TEST("hello123world", "[0-9]+")
--- erwartet
TRUE
FALSE
TRUE

