=== regex replace all (1)
IMPORT "regex"
PRINT REGEX_REPLACE("Hallo Welt", "[aeiou]", "*")
PRINT REGEX_REPLACE("foo123bar456", "[0-9]+", "X")
--- erwartet
H*ll* W*lt
fooXbarX

